$ moolah init --base ILS --no-backup-key
Book "main" is ready in $TMP/data/books/main.db (base currency ILS).
Next: add your accounts, for example:
  moolah account add assets:bank:mybank --currency ILS --opening 1000
  moolah category list

$ moolah book add mom --base USD --no-backup-key
Created book "mom". Switch to it with: moolah book use mom

$ moolah book list
* main
  mom

$ moolah book use mom
Now using book "mom".

$ moolah config get base_currency
USD

$ moolah --book main config get base_currency
ILS

$ moolah book use main
Now using book "main".

$ moolah book list
* main
  mom

$ moolah book use nobody
error: book "nobody" does not exist. Create it with: moolah book add nobody
[exit 1]

